<TXT>Proportion seed mixtures by weight.  Temporary seeding must later be replaced by [Season 1][Season 2] plantings for a permanent stand of grass.  
The same requirements of turf establishment for [Season 1][Season 2] apply for temporary seeding.</TXT><BRK/>
